WEBVTT

01:35.900 --> 01:38.240
[Too Young To Love]

01:38.460 --> 01:41.270
[Episode 15]

01:44.590 --> 01:45.070
Sit.

01:47.680 --> 01:48.150
Sit.

01:49.870 --> 01:50.509
Sit!

01:50.950 --> 01:52.150
Oh.

02:00.070 --> 02:01.670
What did I tell you back then?

02:02.170 --> 02:03.240
Repeat it to me.

02:05.310 --> 02:05.950
You...

02:07.150 --> 02:09.520
asked me to take good care of Lan.

02:09.520 --> 02:10.050
Exactly!

02:11.030 --> 02:13.560
I did ask you to take good care of Lan,
didn't I?

02:13.870 --> 02:14.930
But what happened?

02:15.190 --> 02:15.630
Who...

02:15.870 --> 02:16.530
Who told you

02:16.590 --> 02:16.870
to

02:16.870 --> 02:18.130
do that by kissing her?

02:18.870 --> 02:19.400
Besides,

02:20.020 --> 02:22.030
you knew your parents weren't home,

02:22.079 --> 02:23.310
but you still let Lan stay at your place.

02:23.310 --> 02:24.150
What were you up to?

02:24.150 --> 02:25.590
What was on your mind?

02:31.030 --> 02:31.870
Mr. Yi,

02:33.070 --> 02:33.490
I...

02:33.710 --> 02:36.110
I-I didn't know what I was thinking
either.

02:38.150 --> 02:39.710
I-I just like her.

02:39.710 --> 02:41.910
I want to see her and spend time with her.

02:42.710 --> 02:44.160
So Xiaole

02:44.430 --> 02:46.590
actually likes you, Sister.

02:46.630 --> 02:48.150
What do you mean by "actually"?

02:48.150 --> 02:50.430
Many boys like your sister, alright?

02:51.000 --> 02:52.590
How old are the two of you?

02:53.000 --> 02:55.150
Do you even know what "like" means?

02:56.150 --> 02:56.630
Tell me

02:56.910 --> 02:57.710
what you think

02:57.870 --> 02:59.270
it means to like someone.

03:01.120 --> 03:01.910
Li...

03:02.560 --> 03:03.520
Liking...

03:06.470 --> 03:06.960
Li...

03:07.190 --> 03:07.800
Liking...

03:09.400 --> 03:09.590
Li...

03:09.590 --> 03:09.870
Li...

03:09.870 --> 03:10.310
Liking someone

03:10.310 --> 03:13.110
just comes with the desire to spend time
together.

03:13.310 --> 03:14.630
Don't you dare smirk like that!

03:14.630 --> 03:15.760
Wipe that smirk off!

03:16.630 --> 03:17.630
Lan, I have to go now!

03:17.630 --> 03:18.690
How dare you laugh?

03:50.910 --> 03:52.640
Why didn't you answer my calls?

03:55.150 --> 03:56.210
My phone was taken.

03:56.560 --> 03:57.280
Taken?

03:57.310 --> 03:58.150
Shh.

04:11.870 --> 04:12.710
No way.

04:50.159 --> 04:50.750
Dad.

04:56.200 --> 04:56.510
Dad.

05:01.330 --> 05:02.530
I overslept, you see.

05:03.630 --> 05:05.830
-I'm hungry.
-I'll make you breakfast.

05:15.310 --> 05:16.160
Uncle Dong,

05:16.750 --> 05:19.480
I'm here to drop off Lan's luggage
and cello case.

05:25.220 --> 05:26.750
Uncle Dong, I'm also here to apologize.

05:26.750 --> 05:27.770
I did wrong yesterday.

05:27.770 --> 05:28.510
I'm sorry.

05:28.870 --> 05:30.530
I prepared breakfast for you.

05:30.600 --> 05:31.720
I'll do anything

05:31.720 --> 05:33.180
to earn your forgiveness.

05:33.270 --> 05:33.770
Breakfast!

05:33.770 --> 05:34.570
I'd love some.

06:02.270 --> 06:03.130
It tastes good.

06:10.270 --> 06:12.130
Xiaole seems like a nice guy to me.

06:12.430 --> 06:14.360
It's normal for Lan to date someone

06:14.520 --> 06:15.120
at her age.

06:15.870 --> 06:16.390
Dad,

06:16.950 --> 06:18.750
Xiaole is amazing.

06:19.160 --> 06:21.270
Now I get to brag about

06:21.390 --> 06:23.750
his relationship with Sister at school.

06:24.630 --> 06:26.070
Focus on eating, okay?

06:28.120 --> 06:29.720
Isn't Lan just a little girl?

06:29.790 --> 06:31.320
How can she date anyone now?

06:31.830 --> 06:33.370
It can wait till she turns 25.

06:33.370 --> 06:36.159
I had already been born when you were 25.

06:38.130 --> 06:38.690
You...

06:45.070 --> 06:45.750
Off to a ball game?

06:45.750 --> 06:46.750
Will you go or not?

06:50.630 --> 06:51.190
You're playing chess.

06:51.190 --> 06:52.450
A critical point it is.

06:52.870 --> 06:54.040
You went grocery shopping?

06:54.040 --> 06:55.720
Shopping for food, weren't you?

06:55.720 --> 06:56.430
Yes, just some groceries.

06:56.430 --> 06:57.270
Care to join us?

06:57.270 --> 06:58.190
Sure, a moment later.

06:58.190 --> 06:58.600
Well,

06:58.630 --> 07:00.290
you're not that good a player.

07:01.430 --> 07:02.040
Glad that you know.

07:02.040 --> 07:02.700
Uncle Dong.

07:03.160 --> 07:04.630
Why did you shop for groceries yourself?

07:04.630 --> 07:06.890
Let me run chores like this in the future.

07:06.910 --> 07:07.510
By the way,

07:08.070 --> 07:09.830
you've been working your tail off lately.

07:09.830 --> 07:11.760
Take this. It provides nutrition.

07:12.810 --> 07:15.700
[Bird's Nest]

07:16.630 --> 07:17.630
This brand...

07:17.830 --> 07:19.510
seems quite expensive.

07:21.950 --> 07:23.280
What do you think, Wang?

07:23.870 --> 07:25.730
It's just some lousy bird's nest.

07:28.270 --> 07:29.300
Uncle Wang, I'm heading off.

07:29.300 --> 07:29.870
Go ahead.

07:31.870 --> 07:33.510
He just had to show off, huh?

07:35.600 --> 07:37.270
He's back.

07:42.310 --> 07:43.040
Dad!

07:43.159 --> 07:46.600
Xiaole made a lot of tasty food. Come eat!

07:47.159 --> 07:48.000
So delicious.

07:51.070 --> 07:51.930
I'm not hungry.

07:57.070 --> 07:57.750
But I am.

08:02.040 --> 08:03.300
How about moving this?

08:15.830 --> 08:17.190
Check.

08:21.160 --> 08:22.420
There you are, Xiaole.

08:22.510 --> 08:23.370
Hi, Uncle Wang.

08:23.510 --> 08:24.080
Uncle Li.

08:25.430 --> 08:26.270
Uncle Dong,

08:26.750 --> 08:27.160
I guess

08:27.290 --> 08:29.040
you must be thirsty, aren't you?

08:29.040 --> 08:29.840
Have some tea.

08:30.660 --> 08:31.190
Oh right.

08:31.580 --> 08:33.150
I also brought you pastries

08:33.600 --> 08:34.510
and stuff.

08:34.720 --> 08:35.890
Help yourself

08:36.320 --> 08:37.650
if you get hungry later.

08:37.960 --> 08:39.500
What a considerate young man.

08:39.500 --> 08:42.030
Yes.
He even brought pastries and water here.

08:48.390 --> 08:49.030
Come on.

08:49.470 --> 08:50.070
Have some.

08:50.360 --> 08:51.420
I don't eat sweets.

08:51.550 --> 08:52.410
Just dig in.

08:52.430 --> 08:53.670
Don't stand on ceremony.

08:53.670 --> 08:55.000
Grab a piece, Mrs. Wang.

08:57.550 --> 08:58.750
Hurry up. Make a move.

08:59.390 --> 09:00.240
I just took a pawn of yours.

09:00.240 --> 09:01.030
You did?

09:02.150 --> 09:02.510
I...

09:02.630 --> 09:04.290
I'll take a piece of yours too!

09:05.510 --> 09:06.360
Uncle Dong,

09:06.560 --> 09:09.270
I've always admired you for raising

09:09.300 --> 09:10.870
a wonderful child like Lan.

09:11.020 --> 09:12.790
Today, in the presence of these elders,

09:12.790 --> 09:13.630
I promise

09:13.910 --> 09:14.630
that from now on,

09:14.630 --> 09:15.830
I will treat Lan well.

09:16.200 --> 09:18.550
Not many young people nowadays
can be this thoughtful

09:18.550 --> 09:19.790
and caring.

09:22.510 --> 09:23.910
Okay, I got it.

09:24.450 --> 09:25.250
Just make sure

09:26.150 --> 09:27.280
you treat Lan right.

09:31.460 --> 09:32.400
It's your turn.

09:39.720 --> 09:41.630
We just watched the Dream Orchestra
rehearse.

09:41.630 --> 09:42.560
Did you enjoy it?

09:42.630 --> 09:43.560
I did, of course.

09:43.750 --> 09:45.510
Thank you so much for bringing me here.

09:45.510 --> 09:46.710
You're very welcome.

09:46.790 --> 09:48.170
I've known those musicians since school.

09:48.170 --> 09:48.670
This visit actually

09:48.670 --> 09:50.550
gave me a chance to catch up with them.

09:50.550 --> 09:51.860
It's still early now.

09:52.360 --> 09:53.090
Hello, Ning.

09:53.400 --> 09:54.790
I found a fantastic restaurant.

09:54.790 --> 09:55.990
Let's go there later.

09:57.630 --> 09:59.260
Eating out again?

09:59.480 --> 10:00.910
But I'm a bit occupied now.

10:00.910 --> 10:02.120
I'll call you back soon.

10:02.120 --> 10:02.580
Then...

10:04.280 --> 10:05.740
Do you have a date lined up?

10:06.100 --> 10:06.900
It's nothing.

10:07.200 --> 10:07.730
Let's go.

10:07.870 --> 10:08.270
Okay.

10:11.750 --> 10:14.150
Their chief conductor is so professional.

10:14.750 --> 10:16.150
He's my mentor.

10:18.660 --> 10:19.870
The bar's not far away. It's right ahead.

10:19.870 --> 10:20.240
Okay.

10:24.630 --> 10:26.160
I got you some orange juice.

10:26.670 --> 10:27.270
Thank you.

10:30.410 --> 10:31.270
There's going to be

10:31.270 --> 10:32.390
a party in a few days.

10:32.390 --> 10:33.850
Will you attend it with me?

10:34.150 --> 10:36.210
Many industry leaders will be there.

10:36.270 --> 10:37.000
I believe...

10:37.510 --> 10:39.030
making more new acquaintances

10:39.030 --> 10:40.830
will benefit you in the long run,

10:41.240 --> 10:42.790
especially when you need their help

10:42.790 --> 10:44.320
after coming back from abroad.

10:44.320 --> 10:44.840
Yu,

10:45.360 --> 10:46.670
you've given me so much help

10:46.670 --> 10:48.270
and always looked out for me.

10:48.400 --> 10:50.230
I don't know how to thank you.

10:51.270 --> 10:52.550
Don't even mention it.

10:53.720 --> 10:54.500
Sometimes

10:54.530 --> 10:55.390
when I see you,

10:55.670 --> 10:57.750
I think of when I was studying abroad.

10:57.870 --> 10:58.630
Back then,

10:58.870 --> 11:00.720
my family fell into a terrible state.

11:00.720 --> 11:02.040
I had no choice but to take many odd jobs.

11:02.040 --> 11:03.100
Come to think of it,

11:03.440 --> 11:04.990
that rough patch is finally behind me.

11:04.990 --> 11:05.630
So,

11:06.440 --> 11:07.630
I know what you must be

11:07.630 --> 11:08.230
thinking.

11:18.690 --> 11:19.160
Ning,

11:20.110 --> 11:21.240
do you know that guy?

11:21.510 --> 11:23.170
Why does he keep staring at us?

11:29.330 --> 11:29.830
Yu,

11:30.200 --> 11:31.350
I have something to do.

11:31.350 --> 11:32.210
I need to go now.

11:33.110 --> 11:33.440
Okay.

11:33.470 --> 11:34.000
Alright.

11:37.830 --> 11:38.590
I'm leaving then.

11:38.590 --> 11:38.990
Okay.

11:39.200 --> 11:39.630
Take care.

11:39.630 --> 11:39.890
Yes.

11:40.230 --> 11:40.490
Bye.

11:45.040 --> 11:45.470
Ning!

11:46.920 --> 11:47.510
Ning...

11:51.200 --> 11:52.930
I didn't mean to intrude, Ning.

11:53.230 --> 11:54.230
I followed you...

11:54.320 --> 11:55.110
I followed you in there

11:55.110 --> 11:55.870
because I was curious.

11:55.870 --> 11:57.400
That was all there was to it.

11:57.960 --> 11:59.400
I'm sorry. My apologies.

12:01.680 --> 12:03.470
I only did that out of worry...

12:04.470 --> 12:05.160
Ning.

12:09.400 --> 12:10.200
Ning!

12:11.230 --> 12:11.830
Chen Fan,

12:12.320 --> 12:13.750
my primary goal right now is...

12:13.750 --> 12:15.280
The exchange student spot,

12:15.440 --> 12:15.840
right?

12:16.110 --> 12:17.840
I know that's important to you.

12:19.250 --> 12:20.350
I didn't mean to pry.

12:20.350 --> 12:22.900
I heard about it from Mengmeng
by accident.

12:22.990 --> 12:24.120
I'm in need of money.

12:25.010 --> 12:26.270
I know it sounds tacky,

12:26.350 --> 12:27.440
but this is what I need,

12:27.440 --> 12:28.440
for studying abroad,

12:28.440 --> 12:29.830
my dreams, and my family.

12:29.830 --> 12:30.750
I can help you with...

12:30.750 --> 12:31.960
I know you can.

12:32.470 --> 12:33.710
But I don't want your money.

12:33.710 --> 12:34.710
I don't want your pity.

12:34.710 --> 12:36.110
I reject to depend on anyone,

12:36.110 --> 12:37.470
be it you or my parents.

12:37.870 --> 12:40.440
I'm determined to realize my dreams
with my own efforts.

12:40.440 --> 12:41.440
If you're looking

12:41.590 --> 12:43.720
for a girlfriend who's always around,

12:44.510 --> 12:45.350
I can't be that girl.

12:45.350 --> 12:46.990
I'm not showing you pity.

12:47.830 --> 12:49.870
I'm supportive of you chasing your dreams.

12:49.870 --> 12:51.530
I want to study abroad as well.

12:51.590 --> 12:54.320
I just want to be with you,
no matter where you are.

12:56.710 --> 12:57.510
Chen Fan,

12:58.440 --> 13:00.770
how does being with me solve any problems?

13:01.470 --> 13:02.670
I'm off for practice.

13:03.710 --> 13:04.710
Luo Ningzi,

13:05.110 --> 13:06.440
all of this is weird!

13:06.990 --> 13:09.190
I'm your boyfriend, yet I know nothing.

13:09.510 --> 13:11.110
I spend every day waiting for you
like a fool.

13:11.110 --> 13:12.970
We've never been on a proper date.

13:13.830 --> 13:15.830
I don't even know where your home is!

13:52.230 --> 13:52.830
Yi Lan.

13:57.080 --> 13:57.680
Did you...

13:57.830 --> 13:59.110
prepare all these?

14:00.400 --> 14:02.920
Do you know
how many paper cranes there are?

14:06.230 --> 14:07.040
No.

14:08.120 --> 14:09.850
Three hundred and sixty-four,

14:09.990 --> 14:10.990
only one short

14:12.080 --> 14:13.940
of three hundred and sixty-five.

14:21.800 --> 14:23.000
Unfold it and read it.

14:29.090 --> 14:30.690
Isn't it what I wrote before?

14:31.510 --> 14:33.930
[Please let me have a romance]

14:36.110 --> 14:36.770
Will you...

14:40.700 --> 14:41.580
let me help you

14:42.670 --> 14:45.700
fulfill the wish
written on this piece of paper?

14:51.320 --> 14:51.990
Yes.

14:54.080 --> 14:55.690
Then, what am I to you

14:56.080 --> 14:56.350
now?

15:00.440 --> 15:00.960
My...

15:01.110 --> 15:01.830
boyfriend.

15:02.590 --> 15:03.350
And

15:03.350 --> 15:04.190
you're

15:04.220 --> 15:05.080
my girlfriend.

15:11.080 --> 15:11.710
Well,

15:12.080 --> 15:13.740
you kissed me the other day...

15:13.990 --> 15:16.420
I only intended to kiss your cheek,

15:16.510 --> 15:17.960
but you turned your face around.

15:17.960 --> 15:19.490
You just took my first kiss.

15:21.590 --> 15:23.050
T-That one doesn't count.

15:23.470 --> 15:24.230
The real one

15:25.960 --> 15:26.230
will

15:26.350 --> 15:26.750
happen

15:26.870 --> 15:27.450
today.

15:36.320 --> 15:36.680
Lan!

15:36.710 --> 15:37.630
Lan, i-i-it's time

15:37.630 --> 15:38.230
to go home.

15:38.230 --> 15:38.630
U-Uncle...

15:38.630 --> 15:38.960
Dad!

15:38.960 --> 15:39.620
Uncle Dong.

15:40.140 --> 15:41.870
Xiaole, you should go home too.

15:42.350 --> 15:42.710
Dad,

15:43.040 --> 15:44.080
Xiaole

15:44.470 --> 15:45.440
is my boyfriend now.

15:45.440 --> 15:47.130
You must not be mean to him again.

15:47.130 --> 15:47.400
I...

15:48.130 --> 15:48.470
Wait.

15:48.710 --> 15:50.390
W-When have I ever been mean to him?

15:50.390 --> 15:51.350
Let's go home.

15:51.630 --> 15:52.710
Give them some space.

15:52.710 --> 15:53.200
No.

15:53.470 --> 15:54.990
It's late.
The residents will be disturbed.

15:54.990 --> 15:56.250
You can talk tomorrow.

15:56.350 --> 15:56.740
Lan,

15:56.890 --> 15:57.690
let's go home.

15:57.710 --> 15:58.110
Okay.

15:58.440 --> 15:59.080
Let's go.

15:59.630 --> 16:00.530
Just go.

16:01.470 --> 16:02.750
Go to bed early, Uncle Dong!

16:02.750 --> 16:04.080
I won't be able to sleep!

16:06.110 --> 16:07.910
Don't forget our date tomorrow.

16:08.350 --> 16:08.750
Well,

16:08.830 --> 16:09.830
I'm leaving then.

16:10.350 --> 16:11.610
Aren't you going home?

16:13.350 --> 16:15.410
Not until I put away the paper cranes.

16:15.510 --> 16:16.470
I'll go then.

16:16.750 --> 16:17.320
Bye.

16:22.800 --> 16:23.660
I'll beat that.

16:24.230 --> 16:24.590
A two.

16:25.480 --> 16:26.350
Seriously,

16:26.350 --> 16:28.610
your daughter Lan has great taste in men.

16:28.830 --> 16:29.440
That's for sure.

16:29.440 --> 16:30.200
In fact,

16:30.350 --> 16:32.350
Wang has long had his eyes on Xiaole.

16:32.510 --> 16:33.440
His daughter,

16:33.590 --> 16:34.710
a broadcasting major,

16:34.710 --> 16:35.710
is really pretty.

16:35.960 --> 16:36.750
Unexpectedly,

16:36.750 --> 16:38.830
your daughter Lan snatched Xiaole away.

16:38.830 --> 16:40.580
It's not fair to say that, is it?

16:40.710 --> 16:41.680
Do you mean

16:42.110 --> 16:43.970
Lan is not good enough for Xiaole?

16:44.560 --> 16:46.760
He excels in academics, and that's all.

16:47.200 --> 16:48.350
Listen to yourself.

16:48.590 --> 16:49.190
You should

16:49.230 --> 16:50.590
really change your attitude

16:50.590 --> 16:51.520
towards Xiaole.

16:54.440 --> 16:56.080
My daughter Lan is an excellent kid too,

16:56.080 --> 16:56.680
isn't she?

16:56.990 --> 16:58.710
She'll be a great artist in the future.

16:58.710 --> 16:59.840
Xiaole actually...

16:59.990 --> 17:01.350
owes me respect.

17:01.830 --> 17:02.290
Come on.

17:02.590 --> 17:03.450
Try to top this.

17:03.630 --> 17:04.730
Okay, fine.

17:05.839 --> 17:06.310
A bomb!

17:07.790 --> 17:09.990
Why target me? Only he's the "landlord"!

17:09.990 --> 17:11.640
Because I want to lay down more cards.

17:11.640 --> 17:12.839
Why should I wait for you?

17:12.839 --> 17:14.710
Do you even know how to play cards?
You've become...

17:14.710 --> 17:15.640
I'm done with it!

17:16.990 --> 17:18.550
Dong, do you have to be like this?

17:18.550 --> 17:20.030
We're only having a random chat.

17:20.030 --> 17:21.230
Why lose your temper?

17:21.230 --> 17:22.069
What's all this for?

17:22.069 --> 17:24.470
There are boundaries even in chats, right?

17:24.990 --> 17:25.790
Leave my home!

17:27.470 --> 17:28.200
Fine, I quit.

17:28.200 --> 17:28.660
Oh, you.

17:28.680 --> 17:29.610
The game's over.

17:29.880 --> 17:30.510
Look at him,

17:30.510 --> 17:31.510
so hot tempered.

17:31.990 --> 17:33.650
Where are you going? That way!

17:36.160 --> 17:36.550
Let's go.

17:36.550 --> 17:38.480
H-H-He got so worked up over a game.

17:38.680 --> 17:41.990
You still don't know where the door is,
though you've been here many times.

17:41.990 --> 17:42.510
Uncle Li.

17:42.510 --> 17:43.440
Hello, Xiaole.

17:43.550 --> 17:44.880
You're here too, Uncle Wang.

17:44.880 --> 17:45.270
Take care.

17:45.270 --> 17:45.710
Okay.

17:48.920 --> 17:49.580
Uncle Dong,

17:49.990 --> 17:51.270
you were playing cards?

17:51.270 --> 17:51.870
Oh, right.

17:56.160 --> 17:56.620
What...

17:57.400 --> 17:59.550
do you think of Wang's daughter?

18:00.310 --> 18:00.970
Uncle Dong,

18:01.030 --> 18:02.490
I'm not familiar with her.

18:04.740 --> 18:05.540
Not familiar?

18:06.230 --> 18:06.960
That's good.

18:07.360 --> 18:08.160
There you are.

18:08.270 --> 18:08.990
Lan.

18:15.880 --> 18:16.510
Where...

18:17.470 --> 18:18.750
are you taking Lan?

18:19.470 --> 18:19.790
W-We

18:19.990 --> 18:22.420
are only going for a walk in the park.

18:23.920 --> 18:24.880
The park, huh?

18:26.920 --> 18:27.550
Xuan!

18:28.230 --> 18:28.710
D-Don't

18:28.770 --> 18:30.170
you want to go to the park?

18:30.470 --> 18:31.920
I have to do my homework now.

18:31.920 --> 18:32.780
What homework?

18:32.960 --> 18:34.160
Forget it. Go play in the park!

18:34.160 --> 18:34.560
Hurry.

18:37.750 --> 18:38.550
Come here.

18:39.640 --> 18:40.640
Put on your shoes.

18:41.710 --> 18:42.750
Listen up.

18:44.960 --> 18:46.820
Keep an eye on your sister for Dad.

18:46.990 --> 18:48.200
Have her come home early.

18:48.200 --> 18:49.470
I'll buy you a new toy then.

18:49.470 --> 18:51.360
And I request my favorite one.

18:51.510 --> 18:52.270
Consider it done.

18:52.270 --> 18:52.870
Off you go.

18:53.510 --> 18:54.400
Come here, Xuan.

18:54.400 --> 18:54.860
Come on.

18:55.640 --> 18:57.030
Uncle Dong, rest assured.
I'll take good care of him.

18:57.030 --> 18:57.470
Okay.

19:00.510 --> 19:01.040
Let's go.

19:01.200 --> 19:02.030
Bye, Dad.

19:02.030 --> 19:02.470
Bye.

19:02.470 --> 19:03.600
We're leaving then.

19:05.990 --> 19:07.790
Let's go to the park.

19:08.600 --> 19:09.750
Off to the park!

19:10.750 --> 19:11.510
I guess...

19:11.510 --> 19:12.810
my dad didn't mean any harm.

19:12.810 --> 19:14.410
Hope you don't take offense.

19:16.200 --> 19:16.980
Is Uncle Dong...

19:16.980 --> 19:18.360
still mad about

19:19.030 --> 19:21.640
what happened at my place earlier?

19:22.400 --> 19:22.880
Well...

19:23.510 --> 19:27.070
I don't think so. Otherwise,
he wouldn't have let me go out with you.

19:27.070 --> 19:28.070
That makes sense.

19:29.750 --> 19:30.550
I'm wondering...

19:30.550 --> 19:32.410
what couples usually do on a date.

19:33.230 --> 19:36.270
They hold hands first,
as it is seen on TV.

19:41.880 --> 19:42.590
What's up?

19:43.310 --> 19:44.240
Anything wrong?

19:44.710 --> 19:46.880
Sister, it's like my skin's on fire.

19:46.990 --> 19:48.030
I want to go home.

19:48.030 --> 19:49.830
Didn't we just come out?

19:50.400 --> 19:51.800
It's too early to go home.

19:52.270 --> 19:55.070
But I'm really burning up and starving.

19:55.270 --> 19:57.070
I want to go home.

19:57.440 --> 19:57.860
Look.

19:57.990 --> 19:59.680
My arms are getting tanned.

19:59.680 --> 20:00.960
But you were born this shade.

20:00.960 --> 20:02.650
Sister!

20:06.230 --> 20:06.990
Xuan.

20:08.440 --> 20:10.160
When we get to the convenience store,

20:10.160 --> 20:11.350
how about I buy you

20:11.370 --> 20:13.300
something to eat, drink, and play?

20:15.230 --> 20:16.990
I'm not in the mood for food.

20:17.440 --> 20:19.290
My belly hurts.

20:19.470 --> 20:21.470
I want to go home.

20:21.470 --> 20:23.010
Your belly hurts?

20:23.160 --> 20:23.880
Let me see.

20:30.070 --> 20:30.680
Xuan,

20:31.030 --> 20:32.760
isn't your birthday coming up?

20:33.070 --> 20:34.040
Why don't I...

20:34.230 --> 20:35.920
buy you a birthday present?

20:35.990 --> 20:36.750
You can pick

20:37.030 --> 20:37.990
whatever you want,

20:37.990 --> 20:38.440
okay?

20:38.790 --> 20:39.200
Okay!

20:39.920 --> 20:40.440
Well,

20:40.710 --> 20:41.680
after that,

20:43.270 --> 20:44.990
tell me what your dad said

20:45.200 --> 20:45.990
to you,

20:46.170 --> 20:46.700
will you?

20:46.710 --> 20:47.550
No problem.

20:48.230 --> 20:49.630
Let's make a pinky swear.

20:50.710 --> 20:51.510
Seal the deal.

20:52.230 --> 20:53.090
Come on, kiddo.

20:53.440 --> 20:54.100
Have a bite.

20:55.160 --> 20:55.960
Is it good?

20:57.200 --> 20:57.880
Xuan!

20:59.200 --> 20:59.680
Xuan?

21:03.920 --> 21:05.070
Make a report now.

21:06.680 --> 21:10.620
All Xiaole and Sister did was talk.

21:10.750 --> 21:14.110
I said my belly hurt,
so they brought me home.

21:14.130 --> 21:14.790
Well done.

21:15.230 --> 21:15.890
From now on,

21:16.710 --> 21:18.380
keep watch on them for Dad.

21:18.750 --> 21:19.200
Sure.

21:21.270 --> 21:22.130
Your pocket...

21:37.230 --> 21:37.720
Ning,

21:38.070 --> 21:39.130
are you still busy?

21:39.210 --> 21:40.340
Let's eat together.

21:40.410 --> 21:42.070
I'll wait for you downstairs.

21:44.440 --> 21:45.710
Let it be my treat today.

21:45.710 --> 21:47.630
I was a bit harsh on you last time.

21:47.790 --> 21:48.270
Sorry.

21:49.070 --> 21:51.130
I'll get my stuff and be with you soon.

21:51.790 --> 21:52.400
Ning,

21:52.880 --> 21:54.200
I transferred the pay for the gig to you.

21:54.200 --> 21:54.990
Collect it in time.

21:54.990 --> 21:55.710
Thanks, Yu.

21:56.510 --> 21:57.160
Oh, right.

21:57.470 --> 21:58.200
Here is...

21:58.310 --> 21:59.110
a gift for you.

21:59.990 --> 22:00.470
This...

22:02.030 --> 22:03.090
Don't get me wrong.

22:03.510 --> 22:05.070
That party's coming up, right?

22:05.070 --> 22:07.270
I've noticed that you always carry
a cello case around.

22:07.270 --> 22:08.790
I bet you need a purse.

22:09.030 --> 22:10.920
You'll attend the party as my plus-one.

22:10.920 --> 22:13.520
Just do me a favor
and bring this purse with you.

22:15.510 --> 22:16.230
Take it.

22:17.550 --> 22:18.310
Thank you.

22:21.230 --> 22:22.290
About the young man

22:22.960 --> 22:24.690
we met in the bar previously...

22:24.990 --> 22:26.230
Don't worry about that.

22:26.230 --> 22:27.430
I've taken care of it.

22:27.750 --> 22:29.010
He was Chen Fan, right?

22:30.790 --> 22:32.140
How did you...

22:32.510 --> 22:34.440
Actually, this gig you just did...

22:37.710 --> 22:38.440
Yu.

22:40.160 --> 22:40.880
Actually,

22:41.550 --> 22:42.990
Chen Fan specifically asked me

22:42.990 --> 22:44.550
to choose you for this gig.

22:46.710 --> 22:48.710
He told me to keep it secret from you.

22:49.990 --> 22:50.640
Oh, right.

22:53.360 --> 22:53.960
And this.

22:54.270 --> 22:56.200
He insisted that I keep it,
though I tried to refuse.

22:56.200 --> 22:57.990
A talented musician as you are
doesn't need such help.

22:57.990 --> 22:58.720
How about...

22:58.790 --> 23:00.050
you return this to him?

23:01.710 --> 23:02.440
Just keep it,

23:02.640 --> 23:03.900
since he gave it to you.

23:06.550 --> 23:07.010
Well...

23:07.230 --> 23:08.290
I'll take off then.

23:12.990 --> 23:13.550
Bye.

23:32.710 --> 23:33.230
Ning.

23:36.510 --> 23:37.440
Sit down.

23:41.750 --> 23:43.410
Listen, I've really found...

23:43.610 --> 23:45.470
a fantastic restaurant.

23:46.960 --> 23:47.490
Chen Fan,

23:47.990 --> 23:48.990
tell me the truth.

23:49.470 --> 23:50.270
Did I get a spot

23:50.470 --> 23:51.930
in this gig because of you?

23:57.640 --> 23:59.030
Yes or no?

24:04.470 --> 24:05.230
I was just...

24:06.200 --> 24:07.930
trying to lighten your burden.

24:13.160 --> 24:13.960
Let me ask you.

24:14.710 --> 24:16.570
What exactly do you like about me?

24:17.470 --> 24:18.230
Everything.

24:18.790 --> 24:20.310
I like everything about you.

24:20.310 --> 24:21.510
That's not an answer.

24:21.640 --> 24:22.990
There has to be a reason
for liking someone.

24:22.990 --> 24:24.790
Why does there have to be a reason

24:24.990 --> 24:25.990
for liking someone?

24:25.990 --> 24:26.990
It's how it works.

24:27.230 --> 24:30.290
Motives and plans are needed
before one does anything.

24:30.510 --> 24:32.170
You can't just act on impulse.

24:33.880 --> 24:36.210
How are you so sure
that I don't have a plan?

24:37.470 --> 24:37.990
Fine.

24:38.470 --> 24:39.330
You have a plan.

24:39.920 --> 24:40.580
Then tell me

24:40.960 --> 24:41.960
what your plan is.

24:42.230 --> 24:42.710
I...

24:47.160 --> 24:48.160
So typical of you.

24:48.440 --> 24:49.710
You never think before you act,

24:49.710 --> 24:51.710
knowing that your family
will always have your back.

24:51.710 --> 24:54.030
You're just a loser
relying on your family,

24:54.030 --> 24:55.310
always trying to shape my life

24:55.310 --> 24:56.270
the way you like.

24:56.400 --> 24:58.230
Have you ever considered what I want?

24:58.230 --> 25:00.230
I just hope you can be happy.

25:00.230 --> 25:00.990
Happy?

25:10.070 --> 25:11.200
How to achieve that?

25:11.790 --> 25:13.190
With your family's help?

25:18.230 --> 25:19.470
I hate those relying on their families.
